The folder sebaro-product/ next to this file holds novalis's sign, its sign
tile and its app icon, made by the sebaro export's product kit
(apps/desktop/ui/src/sebaro/product/) from sebaro.product.json and never
edited here (docs/sebaro-luecken.md Z14). It is not under this repository's
